{"Header.scss uses mixins but does not show an explicit import of foundation/mixins within itself, causing potential compile failures if compiled in isolation": 0.0542982742190361, "Many components still use floats (topic.scss, header.scss pre-migration sections, admin coalitions) creating inconsistent layout behavior across pages until floats are removed everywhere": 0.12201137840747833, "CHANGELOG.md is missing or not updated with release notes for foundation/mixins.scss changes or new flexbox mixins": 0.015926362946629524, "Header title changed from float left to @include flexbox() and @include align-items(center), potentially altering flow and alignment if parent is not a flex container": 0.4745367467403412, "New flexbox mixins (flexbox(), inline-flex(), align-items(), order()) introduced in foundation/mixins.scss could cause build failures or inconsistent styling if not consistently applied": 0.25406283140182495, "Foundation mixins are imported before foundation variables in common.scss, inconsistent with other files like foundation/base.scss that import variables first": 0.007448883727192879, ".small-action class now becomes a flex container which could alter spacing and alignment with downstream children that rely on previous float/inline-block behavior": 0.6660252213478088, "Small-action area gains flexbox usage creating dependency on flex container context; if internal structure relies on floats, layout could regress": 0.3730248808860779, "Extra-info-wrapper gains @include order(2) and line-height: 1.5 which may affect alignment with badges and topic title": 0.3020748198032379, "Extra-info-wrapper uses @include order(2) which relies on flex container ancestor; if parent is not flex container, order has no effect": 0.4636712074279785, "Badge bullet styling replaces direct display: inline-flex and align-items with mixins, introducing dependency on new mixins and potentially altering layout for inline badge elements": 0.5245364308357239, "PR description is insufficient, missing detailed description of changes, migration steps, testing plan, and follow-up work": 0.025656351819634438, "No Sass-specific tests found in the repo to test mixin behavior": 0.017474425956606865}